            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EInsurance (including Covid cover) \u00A392\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESingle room supplement \u00A3199\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGratuities\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELunches\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDonations at any churches or cathedrals visited\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFlight details may be subject to change. Price based on twin share. Minimum numbers required. Normal booking conditions apply.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
